cropmanager.fluid_tank_auto_desc=Passively pushes up to %s mB/s to Output faces (0 EU) when Redstone allows.
cropmanager.fluid_tank_rs_desc=Controls Output face drainage and passive auto-eject. Input remains open.
cropmanager.fluid_tank_port_hint=Left-click to cycle: Closed · Input · Output.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank.title=Industrial Fluid Reservoir
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank.desc=Build a hollow 3 × 5 × 3 iron tower with 41 Industrial Tank Casings and 1 controller facing outward on a middle wall. Requires zero EU.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank.info=Stores 128,000 mB of any single fluid (up to 384,000 mB with 8 Capacity Expansions). Configure Input/Output per face, Redstone valve mode, and attach Redstone Comparators to any shell block.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank_casing.title=Industrial Tank Casing
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank_casing.desc=Structural iron casing used for the floor, roof, and walls of the 3 × 5 × 3 Industrial Fluid Reservoir.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_tank_casing.info=Right-click any formed casing to open the controller. External pipes, hoppers, and Redstone Comparators work on exterior casing faces.
tile.cropmanager.fluid_pipe.name=Fluid Pipe
cropmanager.fluid_pipe_help=Automatically transfers fluids between connected tanks and farm machines.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_pipe.title=Fluid Pipe
cropmanager.guide.fluid_pipe.desc=Connects tanks, reservoirs, sprinklers, and farm machines to transfer fluids automatically without EU.
cropmanager.guide.fluid_pipe.info=Pulls from connected output tanks and distributes across the pipe network up to 250 mB every 5 ticks by default. Equalizes bidirectional tanks safely without infinite loops.
