cropmanager.silo_title=Agricultural Grain Silo
cropmanager.silo_unformed=Incomplete silo structure
cropmanager.silo_item_stored=Stored: %s (%s)
cropmanager.silo_stacks_tip=%s stacks + %s items
cropmanager.silo_locked=Template: Locked
cropmanager.silo_unlocked=Template: Unlocked
cropmanager.silo_lock_hint=Click with an item to lock, click to toggle, or right-click empty to clear.
cropmanager.silo_help=3×5×3 single-item bulk silo (no EU). Configure ports, Redstone valve, and comparator.
cropmanager.silo_deposit_tip=Drop items here to deposit into the silo.
cropmanager.silo_withdraw_tip=Click or shift-click to withdraw items from the silo.
cropmanager.silo_capacity_tip=Insert up to 8 Capacity Expansions (+32,000 items each).
cropmanager.silo_comparator_desc=Emitted from controller and casing blocks based on silo fill level.
cropmanager.silo_auto_desc=Passively pushes up to %s items/s to Output faces (0 EU) when Redstone allows.
cropmanager.silo_rs_desc=Controls Output face extraction and passive auto-eject. Input remains open.
cropmanager.guide.agricultural_silo.info=Use a 3×3 base, five layers high, with an empty core. Place the controller facing outward in one of the middle layers. The silo stores one item type at a time.
cropmanager.guide.silo_casing.desc=Forms the walls, floor, and roof of the Agricultural Grain Silo.
cropmanager.guide.silo_casing.info=The structure uses 41 casings and one controller. Once formed, use its exposed faces for item automation.
tile.cropmanager.greenhouse_frame.name=Greenhouse Frame
cropmanager.greenhouse_frame_help=Decorative iron-and-wood structural framing for greenhouses.
tile.cropmanager.garden_trellis.name=Garden Trellis
cropmanager.garden_trellis_help=Decorative wooden lattice for farm borders and greenhouse walls.
tile.cropmanager.farm_lantern.name=Farm Lantern
cropmanager.farm_lantern_help=Decorative glowing lantern for lighting greenhouses and crop fields.
